  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-10411 Early Warning for ALL (EW4ALL): Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">include strengthening national coordination led by the Ethiopia Disaster Risk Management Commission (EDRMC), developing a National Disaster Risk Hub to centralize and share data, and expanding hydrometeorological observation in high-risk areas. Improved communication methods&#x2014;such as SMS alerts, call centers, and community-based systems&#x2014;will ensure vulnerable populations receive timely information. Standardized anticipatory action frameworks, integrated with social protection measures, will build resilience and better protect Ethiopia&#x2019;s most at-risk communities</narrative>
  </description>
